# Refined Protein Structure

---

The single-chain PDB structure was uploaded and submitted to GalaxyRefine for refinement. 5 models were generated.
This directory contains a summary table of all 5 models.

# Workflow

Original PDB Upload to GalaxyRefine
  ↓

Refinement 
  ↓

5 Generated Models
  ↓

Model Evaluation
  ↓

Model Selection
